    <string name="displayInfoTitle">Display</string>
    <string name="displayInfoMessage"><![CDATA[
        <b>QGE (Qube Graphics Engine)</b> is the optimized built-in display wrapper, it receives and displays the frames in native way, without latency<br/><br/>
        <b>VNC (Virtual Network Computing)</b> is the balanced choice for those who want to run the app as a host, it starts QEMU\'s VNC server without opening a viewer inside the app, so you can connect to the VM from any external VNC client instead.
    ]]></string>
