    <string name="videoDisplayInfoTitle">Video Display</string>
    <string name="videoDisplayInfoMessage"><![CDATA[
        <b>std</b> is the standard and stable option that comes with QEMU.<br/><br/>
        <b>cirrus</b> is suitable for older operating systems from the 90s.<br/><br/>
        <b>vmware</b> emulates VMware SVGA, good for Windows.<br/><br/>
        <b>virtio</b> is the paravirtualized GPU without 3D acceleration.<br/><br/>
        <b>virtio-gpu-pci</b> same as virtio but with PCI emulation<br/><br/>
        <b>virtio-gpu-gl-pci</b> enables 3D acceleration via VirGL but with PCI emulation, may not work well with unsupported OSes, but hel